# PostHog project key (docs/mvp.md §5). Autocapture stays off in code either
# way; leaving this unset just means analytics.ts no-ops instead of sending
# events nowhere. Never commit the real value — copy this file to .env.local.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* into the bundle at build time, so this has to be present
# in the environment running `vite build`. A Cloudflare Worker secret is a
# runtime value and cannot reach it — production gets this from the
# VITE_POSTHOG_KEY GitHub secret, wired into the build step in ci.yml.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_...

# Defaults to /ingest, the Worker's PostHog proxy (server/src/routes/ingest.ts).
# Only set this to talk to PostHog directly, or to a different region.
# VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
